WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.080
What's up guys!

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:01.940
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.680
Today, we're playing a penhold tournament

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.780
Let's see who wins!

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.700
So the penhold grip is the traditional Chinese

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.040
table tennis grip

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.200
So you basically hold the racket like a pen

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.700
First match, me versus Emil

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.740
Let's go!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.440
To be honest I think I'm gonna lose this one

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.420
Well, I think so too so...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.240
Good luck!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.700
I think I should have

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.360
moved a bit better but

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.160
I don't want to

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.160
This is going pretty well

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.199
I remember I have said that before too

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.420
and then I lost all the points after that

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.440
I'm giving you a head start

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.980
Still giving a head start

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:24.140
Still?

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:25.420
Still

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.140
I have to give him one point

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:30.180
Thanks

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.020
I tried like a side spin

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:43.920
I don't know

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.440
You don't know what you tried

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.160
No...

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.500
Now you started playing, did you Otto?

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.920
Yeah I had to

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.200
Wow, nice forehand Emil

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:03.920
Thank you

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.040
The chop block didn't quite work there

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.800
I won't miss those anymore

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.320
No, what am I doing?

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.400
I came too close and I wasn't like

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.400
should I take the backhand or forehand

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.260
That was good

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.180
Thanks

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.340
What?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.240
That wasn't supposed to go in!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.400
No it wasn't

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:05.960
Zero zero

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.600
I tried to set you up for a little

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:20.920
Counter smash

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.240
My serves are exactly the same as normal

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:37.320
That's true

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.240
I hit it with the finger

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.100
Wait, new!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.220
"Thanks"

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:02.400
Oh sorry

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:03.640
That was too difficult

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.020
I was just trying to hurt Emil there

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:11.840
Clearly

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.600
I expected you to go around the net

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:34.240
A bit stiff

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.460
Wow! That was good

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.640
Safe shots

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:14.340
This much

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.880
I was a bit trapped in here

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.180
Luckily it didn't come on the table

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.940
I'm not sure what I was waiting there

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:47.780
Thanks

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:57.760
You have a backhand

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.040
I'm really sorry

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.220
That's the only way you're gonna win this match

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:09.560
More of those

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.600
I need only ten more

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.032
You haven't seen my

00:06:12.032 --> 00:06:12.880
good serve yet

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.380
Bring it

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.640
Okay, that serve is okay

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.640
I'm sorry

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:29.900
I shouldn't laugh

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:31.020
You're laughing now but

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.320
9-9 when i rip that backhand on

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:35.080
then we see who's laughing

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.240
Yeah you can always dream!

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.940
It's good to have dreams in your life

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.180
He is going for the backhand

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.800
You see that is top spin, Otto

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:50.340
Oh he's serious!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.060
He's serious, look at him jumping!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:00.600
Come on

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.160
5-3

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.260
That was like the screamer guy

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.120
Good rally though boys

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.480
Ok I need to calm down a bit

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.060
I've never seen Otto this excited

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:29.880
Me neither

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.500
I have to give it to you that was a good shot

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:41.060
I should have just kept pushing like Otto did

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.500
I said I was gonna calm down

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.100
That means pushing

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.940
Oh I'm so sorry Otto

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.840
Had to go for it

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.440
Sorry!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.960
There is as much in stake in this match as
the

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:23.840
500k

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.040
subscribers

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.100
No i think this is more!

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.500
This is even more

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:31.400
I missed it

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:33.300
it would have been so perfect

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.160
I could have just seen you miss the

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:35.860
backhand receive

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.140
I would have gone around the net

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:39.580
Backhand serve

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.140
Wait

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.820
Well look at that!

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:05.300
Match point!

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.200
Match point

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.500
Sensei is going to lose this one

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.000
9-10

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.220
Yes!

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.240
It happened!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.680
The Sensei is beaten

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.840
As I said

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.120
I'm gonna lose that one

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.820
never even had a chance

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.480
How does it feel to be beaten Otto?

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:28.480
Yeah good

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:29.600
You know

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:30.780
Nice change

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:31.780
Being always on top

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.000
It's hard mentally

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:33.840
yeah yeah

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.300
mentally so it's good to lose sometimes

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:37.920
to keep your life balanced

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:38.680
Yeah

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.480
Keeps you on the ground I would say

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.140
So that you're not too good

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.700
Yeah, exactly

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.160
And also this relieves some pressure

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.100
so you don't have to

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.760
keep on winning everything

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.760
I don't have to win all the time so

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.020
I think it's really good

